# Enquiry Routing

## Full athlete journey

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Parent submits enquiry]) --> Val{Valid?}
    Val -->|No| Err[422 error]
    Val -->|Yes| DB[Insert enquiry]
    DB --> Age{Age group?}
    Age -->|U11 waitlist| WL[Academy waitlist\n+ email]
    Age -->|Taster / no DOB| Inv[Booking invite\n+ email]

    WL --> WaitPath([Parent waits for\nAcademy offer])
    Inv --> BookPage[Parent opens\n/book/token]
    BookPage --> Book[Books session\nPOST /api/booking]
    Book --> Session([Session day])

    Session --> Coach[Coach checks in\nvia coach app]
    Coach --> Attend[Admin marks attended\nPOST /api/admin/bookings/:id/attendance]
    Attend --> OTP[membership_otp created\nmembership_invite email sent]
    OTP --> Join[Parent completes\n/join?token=...]
    Join --> Athlete[athletes record\ncreated]
    Athlete --> Member([Regular member\non coach register])
```

## Invite lifecycle

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending : createInviteForEnquiry
    pending --> sent : Email sent successfully
    pending --> failed : 3 send attempts exhausted
    sent --> accepted : Parent books session
    sent --> expired : 14 days pass (expire cron)
    expired --> sent : Admin resends
    failed --> sent : Admin resends
    accepted --> [*]
```

## Academy path in detail

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent
    participant Platform
    participant D1
    participant Resend

    Parent->>Platform: POST /api/enquiry (child age ≤10)
    Platform->>D1: addToWaitlist()
    Platform->>Resend: sendAcademyWaitlist()
    Platform-->>Parent: 201 { path: 'academy' }

    Note over Platform: Admin opens season via Settings

    Platform->>Resend: sendAcademyInvite() per athlete
    Parent->>Platform: GET /academy/respond/[token]
    Parent->>Platform: POST /api/academy/respond { response: 'yes' }
    Platform->>D1: recordWaitlistResponse()
    Platform-->>Parent: Thank-you page

    Note over Platform: 0 9 1 * * cron runs
    Platform->>D1: Close season, roll over unplaced entries
    Note over D1: Returning athletes flagged with is_returning=1
```

